Question Text: \begin{tabular}{|c|c|} \hline TVs & Frequency \\ \hline \( 0 \) & \( 0 \) \\ \hline \( 1 \) & \( 7 \) \\ \hline \( 2 \) & \( 2 \) \\ \hline \( 3 \) & \( 5 \) \\ \hline \( 4 \) & \( 12 \) \\ \hline \end{tabular}
Answer A Text: \( 3 \)
